    "label": "02 미연시",
    "html": "\n        <div style=\"background:#fbf7fb;border-radius:18px;overflow:hidden;font-family:Pretendard,sans-serif;color:#3c3346;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(80,40,90,.12)\">\n          <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:14px 20px;background:#fff;border-bottom:1px solid #f0e4f0\">\n            <div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px\"><span style=\"font:600 10.5px 'JetBrains Mono',monospace;letter-spacing:.2em;color:#d178a8\">ROUTE · 서하</span><b style=\"font:400 20px 'Jua',sans-serif;color:#3c3346\">방과 후, 옥상에서</b></div>\n            <div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-end;gap:4px;font-size:11px;color:#a58aa8\">호감도<div style=\"display:flex;gap:3px\"><i style=\"width:14px;height:6px;border-radius:3px;background:#e98bb9\"></i><i style=\"width:14px;height:6px;border-radius:3px;background:#e98bb9\"></i><i style=\"width:14px;height:6px;border-radius:3px;background:#e98bb9\"></i><i style=\"width:14px;height:6px;border-radius:3px;background:#f2dcea\"></i><i style=\"width:14px;height:6px;border-radius:3px;background:#f2dcea\"></i></div></div>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px;padding:14px 16px;background:#fff\">\n            <div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;background:#fdf1f7;border-radius:14px;padding:10px\"><div style=\"width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:14px;flex:none;background:repeating-linear-gradient(135deg,#f6d8e8 0 6px,#f0cadf 6px 12px);display:flex;align-items:flex-end;justify-content:center;font:9px 'JetBrains Mono',monospace;color:rgba(0,0,0,.35);padding-bottom:6px\">CHAR</div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px\"><span style=\"font:600 10px 'JetBrains Mono',monospace;color:#d178a8\">HEROINE</span><b style=\"font:400 17px 'Jua',sans-serif\">서하</b><span style=\"font-size:11.5px;color:#a58aa8\">1학년 · 방송부</span></div></div>\n            <div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;background:#f1f3fc;border-radius:14px;padding:10px\"><div style=\"width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:14px;flex:none;background:repeating-linear-gradient(135deg,#dde2f7 0 6px,#d2d8f2 6px 12px);display:flex;align-items:flex-end;justify-content:center;font:9px 'JetBrains Mono',monospace;color:rgba(0,0,0,.35);padding-bottom:6px\">USER</div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px\"><span style=\"font:600 10px 'JetBrains Mono',monospace;color:#8a9ae0\">PLAYER</span><b style=\"font:400 17px 'Jua',sans-serif\">나</b><span style=\"font-size:11.5px;color:#a58aa8\">2학년 · 귀가부</span></div></div>\n            <div style=\"grid-column:1/-1;display:flex;gap:6px;font-size:11px;color:#a58aa8\"><span style=\"background:#f7eef6;border-radius:10px;padding:3px 9px\">MODEL GPT-5.1</span><span style=\"background:#f7eef6;border-radius:10px;padding:3px 9px\">PROMPT 옥상 v3</span><span style=\"background:#f7eef6;border-radius:10px;padding:3px 9px\">♪ 방과 후의 테마</span></div>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"position:relative;aspect-ratio:16/10;background:repeating-linear-gradient(135deg,#f3dce9 0 12px,#eed2e2 12px 24px)\">\n            <span style=\"position:absolute;top:14px;left:16px;font:11px 'JetBrains Mono',monospace;color:#b98aa6\">배경 CG · 16:10</span>\n            <div style=\"position:absolute;left:14px;right:14px;bottom:14px\">\n              <span style=\"position:relative;z-index:1;display:inline-block;background:#e98bb9;color:#fff;font:400 15px 'Jua',sans-serif;padding:5px 18px;border-radius:12px 12px 0 0;margin-left:14px\">서하</span>\n              <div style=\"background:rgba(255,255,255,.9);border:2px solid #f4c6dd;border-radius:16px;padding:14px 18px 22px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;position:relative\">“또 여기 있었네. 선배, 종례 끝난 지 한참 됐거든요?”<span style=\"position:absolute;right:14px;bottom:8px;color:#e98bb9;font-size:11px\">▼</span></div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"padding:18px 16px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px\">\n            <div style=\"background:#fff;border:1.5px solid #eadbe9;border-radius:16px;padding:14px 18px;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.8;color:#6a5d70\">바람이 난간을 타고 넘어왔다. 운동장에서 누군가 공을 차는 소리가 멀리서 울렸다.</div>\n            <div style=\"align-self:flex-end;max-width:80%;border:2px dashed #c7b2e6;border-radius:16px;padding:10px 16px;font-size:14px;color:#8b73b8;font-style:italic;background:#faf7fe\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;display:block;margin-bottom:2px\">나 · 속마음</span>지금 아니면, 졸업까지 못 말할 것 같아.</div>\n            <div>\n              <span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#8a9ae0;color:#fff;font:400 15px 'Jua',sans-serif;padding:5px 18px;border-radius:12px 12px 0 0;margin-left:14px\">나</span>\n              <div style=\"background:#fff;border:2px solid #d6dcf6;border-radius:16px;padding:14px 18px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.7\">“너 기다렸어. 오늘은 말할 게 있어서.”</div>\n            </div>\n            <div>\n              <span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#e98bb9;color:#fff;font:400 15px 'Jua',sans-serif;padding:5px 18px;border-radius:12px 12px 0 0;margin-left:14px\">서하</span>\n              <div style=\"background:#fff;border:2px solid #f4c6dd;border-radius:16px;padding:14px 18px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.7\">“……말할 거라니, 뭔데요. 갑자기 그러면 긴장되잖아요.”</div>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;padding:6px 20px\">\n              <div style=\"background:#3c3346;color:#fff;border-radius:22px;padding:11px 18px;font-size:14px;display:flex;gap:10px\"><span style=\"color:#e98bb9\">▶</span>좋아한다고 말한다</div>\n              <div style=\"background:#fff;border:1.5px solid #d9cadb;border-radius:22px;padding:11px 18px;font-size:14px;color:#8a7c8f;display:flex;gap:10px\"><span>▷</span>사실 아무것도 아니라고 한다</div>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;margin-top:4px\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;background:#fff;border:1.5px solid #eadbe9;border-radius:14px;padding:10px 14px;font-size:13.5px\"><span style=\"font:400 18px 'Jua',sans-serif;color:#e98bb9\">02</span>도서관에서 생긴 일<span style=\"margin-left:auto;font-size:11.5px;color:#a58aa8\">1개 메시지 ▾</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;background:#fff;border:1.5px solid #eadbe9;border-radius:14px;padding:10px 14px;font-size:13.5px\"><span style=\"font:400 18px 'Jua',sans-serif;color:#e98bb9\">04</span>축제 전날<span style=\"margin-left:auto;font-size:11.5px;color:#a58aa8\">잠김</span></div></div>\n            <div style=\"text-align:center;font:600 10.5px 'JetBrains Mono',monospace;letter-spacing:.2em;color:#c6a7c1;padding-top:8px\">— SAVE 03 · 작가의 말: 다음 루트는 도서부 —</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      "
