    "label": "03 SNS",
    "html": "\n        <div style=\"background:#fff;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;color:#111;font-family:Pretendard,sans-serif;border:1px solid #e3e3e3\">\n          <div style=\"padding:18px 20px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px\"><b style=\"font-size:18px;letter-spacing:-.02em\">#컴백_D-1</b><span style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#888\">실시간 · 게시물 3.2만</span><span style=\"margin-left:auto;font-size:12px;border:1px solid #111;border-radius:14px;padding:4px 10px\">팔로우</span></div>\n          <div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;border-bottom:1px solid #eee\">\n            <div style=\"padding:14px 20px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;border-right:1px solid #eee\"><div style=\"height:44px;margin:-14px -20px 0;background:repeating-linear-gradient(135deg,#eef0f4 0 6px,#e6e9ef 6px 12px)\"></div><div style=\"width:54px;height:54px;border-radius:50%;flex:none;background:#ddd;border:3px solid #fff;margin-top:-30px;display:flex;align-items:flex-end;justify-content:center;font:9px 'JetBrains Mono',monospace;color:rgba(0,0,0,.35);padding-bottom:6px\">CHAR</div><b style=\"font-size:15px\">한이안 <span style=\"color:#1d9bf0\">✔</span></b><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#888\">@ian_official · 팔로워 412만</span><span style=\"font-size:12.5px\">무대 위에선 완벽, 폰 앞에선 허당</span></div>\n            <div style=\"padding:14px 20px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px\"><div style=\"height:44px;margin:-14px -20px 0;background:repeating-linear-gradient(135deg,#f4eeee 0 6px,#efe6e6 6px 12px)\"></div><div style=\"width:54px;height:54px;border-radius:50%;flex:none;background:#222;border:3px solid #fff;margin-top:-30px;display:flex;align-items:flex-end;justify-content:center;font:9px 'JetBrains Mono',monospace;color:rgba(0,0,0,.35);padding-bottom:6px\">USER</div><b style=\"font-size:15px\">유도윤</b><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#888\">@doyoon · 같은 팀 막내</span><span style=\"font-size:12.5px\">형 계정 관리 담당(비공식)</span></div>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"padding:12px 20px;background:#f7f7f7;font-size:13px;color:#666;border-bottom:1px solid #eee\">새벽 2시 14분 · 연습실 불이 아직 켜져 있다. 멤버 단톡은 조용했고, 공식 계정만 바빴다.</div>\n          <div style=\"padding:16px 20px;display:flex;gap:12px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee\">\n            <i style=\"flex:none;width:42px;height:42px;border-radius:50%;background:repeating-linear-gradient(45deg,#ddd 0 4px,#eee 4px 8px)\"></i>\n            <div style=\"flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px\">\n              <div style=\"display:flex;gap:6px;align-items:baseline;font-size:14px\"><b>한이안</b><span style=\"color:#888\">@ian_official · 2분</span></div>\n              <div style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:1.6\">내일 무대 끝나면 할 말 있어요. 진짜로.</div>\n              <div style=\"aspect-ratio:4/3;border-radius:12px;background:repeating-linear-gradient(135deg,#eee 0 10px,#e6e6e6 10px 20px);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font:11px 'JetBrains Mono',monospace;color:#999\">첨부 사진 · 4:3</div>\n              <div style=\"display:flex;gap:26px;font-size:12.5px;color:#888\"><span>답글 812</span><span>재게시 4.1천</span><span style=\"color:#e0245e\">♥ 2.8만</span></div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"padding:14px 20px;display:flex;gap:12px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;position:relative\">\n            <i style=\"position:absolute;left:40px;top:0;width:2px;height:14px;background:#ddd\"></i>\n            <i style=\"flex:none;width:42px;height:42px;border-radius:50%;background:#111\"></i>\n            <div style=\"flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px\">\n              <div style=\"display:flex;gap:6px;align-items:baseline;font-size:14px\"><b>유도윤</b><span style=\"color:#888\">@doyoon · 1분</span></div>\n              <span style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#888\">@ian_official 님에게 보내는 답글</span>\n              <div style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:1.6\">형 그거 공개적으로 쓰는 거 아니라고 했잖아요</div>\n              <div style=\"border:1px solid #e3e3e3;border-radius:12px;padding:10px 12px;font-size:13.5px;color:#444;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:3px\"><b style=\"font-size:12.5px\">매니저 K <span style=\"color:#888;font-weight:400\">@mgr_k</span></b>둘 다 폰 내려놓고 자라. 지금.</div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"margin:12px 20px;border:1.5px dashed #bbb;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 14px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px;background:#fafafa\"><span style=\"font-size:11.5px;color:#888\">임시저장 · 올리지 않은 글 (속마음)</span><span style=\"font-size:14.5px;color:#555\">사실 하고 싶은 말은 무대 끝나고가 아니라 지금인데.</span></div>\n          <div style=\"padding:12px 20px;text-align:center;font-size:13px;color:#1d9bf0;border-top:1px solid #eee\">이전 게시물 12개 더 보기 ▾</div>\n          <div style=\"padding:12px 20px;font-size:12.5px;color:#888;display:flex;justify-content:space-between\"><span>작가의 말 · 다음 편은 무대 직후 · GPT-5.1</span><a style=\"color:#1d9bf0\">🔗 멤버 프로필</a></div>\n        </div>\n      "
